---
import SalesLayout from '../layouts/SalesLayout.astro';
import SectionEyebrow from '../components/SectionEyebrow.astro';
---

<SalesLayout
  title="The 4-Week Vitality Reset — Full Transformation with Live Coaching | Vayda Wellness"
  description="Four weeks, four live group calls, one complete reset. The 4-Week Vitality Reset with Ramesh — $497. Includes private 1:1 consultation."
>

  <header class="bg-white border-b border-beige py-4">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 flex justify-center">
      <a href="/">
        <img src="/brand/logo-nav-new.png" alt="Vayda Wellness" class="h-10" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="bg-forest text-cream relative bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('/photos/ramesh/yoga-class-stretching.jpg')">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-forest/70"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 text-center">

      <span class="inline-block bg-cream/20 text-cream border border-cream/30 font-sans text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full px-5 py-2 mb-8">
        Limited Spots per Cohort
      </span>

      <h1 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-4xl md:text-[56px] leading-tight mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Four Weeks to Reclaim Your Body, Your Energy, and Your Life.
      </h1>

      <p class="font-sans text-sm text-cream/60 tracking-wide mb-4">
        Live group coaching with Ramesh — plus weekly lessons, daily practices, and your private consultation.
      </p>

      <p class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl text-cream/80 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The full transformation. Four weeks, four calls, one complete reset — with Ramesh guiding you every step of the way.
      </p>

      <a
        href="#buy"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-cream text-forest font-sans font-semibold text-base tracking-wide px-10 py-5 rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all mb-6"
      >
        Claim My Spot — $497
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>

      <p class="font-sans text-sm text-cream/60 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-10">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        30-Day Money-Back Guarantee · All Calls Recorded
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 md:gap-10">
        {['100+ Transformed', 'Live Coaching', 'Science-Based'].map((stat) => (
          <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cream/40">{stat}</span>
        ))}
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">

        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-3xl md:text-[42px] text-charcoal leading-tight mb-10">
          A Message from Ramesh
        </h2>

        <div class="aspect-video w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-forest/10 border border-beige flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <div class="text-center text-charcoal/40">
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="mx-auto mb-3">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
            </svg>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm mt-3">Video loading — Wistia ID pending</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-charcoal/50 text-center">
          Ramesh explains why four weeks of structured, supported transformation creates results that last — and what makes this program different.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">

        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-3xl md:text-[42px] text-charcoal leading-tight mb-10">
          You've Tried the Quick Fixes. They Helped — But Something Deeper Is Still Off.
        </h2>

        <p class="font-sans text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-lg mb-10">
          You know your body is capable of more. You've had glimpses — days where the energy was there, where sleep actually worked, where your digestion felt quiet and calm. But they don't stay. The patterns keep returning, and each time they do, they take a little more of your confidence with them. Deep change doesn't happen in a weekend. It needs time, structure, and someone who knows what they're doing.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 mb-12 text-left">
          {[
            "A 7-day protocol can start the process — but chronic patterns took years to build. They need more than a week to fully unwind.",
            "Without ongoing support, it's easy to slip back. The body needs consistent signals over time to create lasting change.",
            "Doing it alone is the hardest part. Accountability, community, and a coach who knows your body make all the difference.",
          ].map((text) => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-cream rounded-2xl p-5 border border-beige">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-beige flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#657F66" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/>
                  <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/>
                  <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="font-sans text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">{text}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="bg-forest/[0.08] border border-forest/20 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <p class="font-sans text-charcoal leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-forest block text-lg mb-2">"This is where the real work happens."</strong>
            Four weeks of guided transformation — with Ramesh beside you every step of the way.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-forest text-cream">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">

      <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-3xl md:text-[48px] leading-tight mb-14 text-center">
        4 Weeks From Now
      </h2>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-cream/10 border border-cream/20 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cream/40 mb-6">Before</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            {[
              'Chronic fatigue despite "fixing" your sleep',
              'Digestive issues that keep returning',
              'Stress response that won\'t reset',
              'Making progress then sliding back',
              'Navigating your health alone',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-sans text-cream/60">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="flex-shrink-0">
                  <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/>
                  <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/>
                </svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-cream text-forest rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-forest/40 mb-6">After</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            {[
              'Sustainable energy without caffeine',
              'Digestion that works predictably',
              'Nervous system that can genuinely rest',
              'Results that hold — and keep building',
              'A coach and community in your corner',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-sans text-forest font-medium">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="flex-shrink-0">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
                </svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="w-full overflow-hidden" style="height: 300px">
    <img src="/photos/ramesh/ramesh-meditating-plants.jpg" alt="The transformation process" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" />
  </div>

  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">

      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-3xl md:text-[42px] text-charcoal">
          The Full 4-Week Experience
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-charcoal/50 uppercase tracking-widest text-center mb-8">Your 4-Week Journey</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-14">
          {[
            {
              week: '01',
              title: 'Foundation & Detox',
              desc: 'Reset your baseline. First group call. Daily audio practices begin. Community opens.',
              accent: 'bg-forest',
            },
            {
              week: '02',
              title: 'Deepening',
              desc: 'Nutrition intensive. Video lesson on gut-brain connection. Audio practices continue.',
              accent: 'bg-[#4a7a55]',
            },
            {
              week: '03',
              title: 'Integration',
              desc: 'Advanced practices. Third group call. Building the habits that stick.',
              accent: 'bg-charcoal',
            },
            {
              week: '04',
              title: 'Vitality',
              desc: 'Final group call. Your private consultation with Ramesh. Measuring your transformation.',
              accent: 'bg-forest',
            },
          ].map((wk) => (
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-beige overflow-hidden shadow-sm flex flex-col">
              <div class={`${wk.accent} px-6 py-5 flex items-center gap-4`}>
                <span class="font-serif font-bold italic text-5xl text-white/30 leading-none">{wk.week}</span>
                <h4 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-white text-xl leading-snug">{wk.title}</h4>
              </div>
              <div class="p-6">
                <p class="font-sans text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-sm">{wk.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-beige p-8">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal/40 mb-6">Everything Included</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            {[
              '4 Live Group Calls with Ramesh (2 hrs each — 8 hrs total live coaching)',
              'Weekly Video Lessons (lifetime access)',
              '28 Daily Audio Practices',
              'Private Community Access',
              'Private 1:1 Consultation with Ramesh — 45 min (Value: $200)',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-charcoal/80">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D4A35" stroke-width="2.5" class="flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
                </svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-sm mx-auto text-center bg-white rounded-2xl border border-beige p-8">
        <p class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal/40 mb-5">Value Breakdown</p>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-left mb-6">
          {[
            { label: 'Group Calls (4 × $125)', value: '$500' },
            { label: 'Weekly Video Lessons', value: '$197' },
            { label: 'Daily Audio Practices', value: '$97' },
            { label: 'Community Access', value: '$47' },
            { label: 'Private Consultation', value: '$200' },
          ].map((row) => (
            <div class="flex justify-between font-sans text-sm text-charcoal/70">
              <span>{row.label}</span>
              <span class="font-medium">{row.value}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
          <div class="border-t border-beige pt-3 flex justify-between font-sans font-semibold text-charcoal">
            <span>Total Value</span>
            <span class="line-through text-charcoal/40">$1,041</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-charcoal/50 mb-1 text-sm">Today</p>
        <p class="font-serif font-bold italic text-4xl text-forest">$497</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="bg-beige py-12 text-center">
    <p class="font-sans text-sm text-charcoal/60 mb-4 tracking-wide">Ready to go deeper?</p>
    <a href="#buy" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-forest text-cream font-sans font-semibold px-10 py-5 rounded-full hover:bg-forest/90 hover:shadow-xl transition-all">
      Claim My Spot — $497 →
    </a>
    <p class="font-sans text-xs text-charcoal/40 mt-3">30-day money-back guarantee · All calls recorded</p>
  </div>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">

      <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-3xl md:text-[42px] text-charcoal text-center mb-14">
        What Others Experienced
      </h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {[
          {
            quote: '"I\'d done other programs, but the live calls with Ramesh changed everything. Week 3 was when it clicked — I finally understood what my body had been trying to tell me for years. I feel 15 years younger."',
            initials: 'PM',
            name: 'Patricia M.',
            role: 'Retired Teacher, Age 62',
          },
          {
            quote: '"I did the 7-Day Reset first. Good. This was different. The community, the weekly calls, the structure — I didn\'t feel alone for the first time in a health program. My energy is completely transformed."',
            initials: 'DR',
            name: 'David R.',
            role: 'Business Owner, 54',
          },
          {
            quote: '"I help clients with health every day, so I almost skipped this. But Ramesh\'s depth and the group dynamic gave me breakthroughs I couldn\'t get on my own. I\'ve referred three clients already."',
            initials: 'AS',
            name: 'Anita S.',
            role: 'Health Coach, 49',
          },
        ].map((t) => (
          <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8 border border-beige flex flex-col">
            <div class="flex gap-1 mb-5">
              {[1,2,3,4,5].map(() => (
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#2D4A35">
                  <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
                </svg>
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="font-serif italic text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed flex-grow mb-6">{t.quote}</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-forest text-cream font-sans font-semibold text-sm flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                {t.initials}
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-sans font-semibold text-sm text-charcoal">{t.name}</p>
                <p class="font-sans text-sm text-charcoal/50">{t.role}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/photos/ramesh-founder.jpg"
            alt="Ramesh Roar, Co-founder Prama Institute"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <SectionEyebrow text="Meet Your Guide" />
          <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-3xl md:text-[42px] text-charcoal leading-tight mb-8">
            Why I Created This
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-5 font-sans text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
            <p>In 2004, I was diagnosed with <strong>chronic prostatitis</strong>.</p>
            <p>I'd been a vegetarian for 30 years. Ate organic. Practiced yoga daily.</p>
            <p><strong>And I suffered for over 3 years.</strong></p>
            <p>Doctors gave me antibiotics. Pain management. The usual. Nothing worked.</p>
            <p>Then I discovered <strong>juice fasting</strong>. 5 weeks later, I was symptom-free. I'd lost 50 pounds. And I finally understood what my body had been trying to tell me.</p>
            <p>Since then, I've helped <strong>thousands of people</strong> through the Prama Institute decode their own signals and reclaim their vitality.</p>
          </div>

          <p class="font-serif italic text-lg text-charcoal mt-8">
            — Ramesh Roar<br />
            <span class="font-sans text-sm text-charcoal/50 not-italic">Co-founder, Prama Institute · 20+ years</span>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">

      <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-3xl md:text-[42px] text-charcoal text-center mb-14">
        Common Questions
      </h2>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
        {[
          {
            q: 'How does the live call schedule work?',
            a: 'Calls are weekly, scheduled at program start. Each call is 2 hours with Ramesh and the full cohort. All calls are recorded for those who can\'t attend live.',
          },
          {
            q: 'What if I miss a live call?',
            a: 'All calls are recorded and available within 24 hours in the community portal. You\'ll never miss the content — though live attendance creates the most impact.',
          },
          {
            q: 'Is this right for me if I haven\'t done the 7-Day Reset?',
            a: 'Yes — the 4-Week program is designed as a complete experience. The 7-Day Reset is a great intro, but it\'s not required. Many participants come in without having done it first.',
          },
          {
            q: 'What\'s the refund policy?',
            a: '30-day money-back guarantee. If you complete Week 1 and don\'t feel it\'s right for you, email us for a full refund — no questions asked.',
          },
          {
            q: 'How is this different from working with Ramesh 1:1?',
            a: 'The group format creates a powerful shared energy that 1:1 doesn\'t have — the community, the shared breakthroughs, the accountability. You also get the private consultation included, so you get both.',
          },
        ].map((faq) => (
          <details class="group border border-beige rounded-2xl bg-white overflow-hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-charcoal pr-4">{faq.q}</span>
              <svg
                width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                class="flex-shrink-0 text-charcoal/40 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"
              >
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6">
              <p class="font-sans text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed">{faq.a}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="buy" class="bg-forest text-cream">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">

        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold italic text-4xl md:text-[52px] leading-tight mb-6">
          Your 4-Week Transformation Starts Now
        </h2>

        <p class="font-sans text-cream/70 mb-12">
          Next cohort begins soon — spots are limited.
        </p>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <p class="font-sans text-cream/50 text-lg line-through mb-1">Value: $1,041</p>
          <p class="font-serif font-bold text-6xl text-cream mb-2">$497</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-cream/50 uppercase tracking-widest">One-time · All Calls Recorded</p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://buy.stripe.com/PLACEHOLDER"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-cream text-forest font-sans font-semibold text-lg tracking-wide px-12 py-5 rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:shadow-2xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all mb-8 w-full sm:w-auto"
        >
          Claim My Spot — $497
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 mb-10 text-cream/60">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-sm">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
            30-Day Money-Back Guarantee
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-sm">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M15 10l4.553-2.069A1 1 0 0 1 21 8.87v6.26a1 1 0 0 1-1.447.894L15 14M3 8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H3z"/>
            </svg>
            All Calls Recorded
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-sm">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
            Limited Cohort
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-sm">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            </svg>
            Private Consultation Included
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-cream/10 border border-cream/20 rounded-2xl p-8 flex items-start gap-5 text-left">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-cream/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-sans font-semibold text-cream mb-2">30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-cream/70 leading-relaxed">
              Complete Week 1. If you don't feel it's right for you, email us within 30 days for a full refund — no questions asked.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="bg-charcoal text-white/40 py-10">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-6 text-center space-y-3">
      <img src="/brand/logo-footer-new.png" alt="Vayda Wellness" class="h-8 mx-auto mb-4" />
